#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1009 expect=violation domain=TE
#note "ADAPTED-FROM fda/FDA-SD1009/FDA-SD1009-invalid-TE.cdt (data and pins verbatim; note the twin deliberately puts the firing row FIRST here, unlike its SE fixture). Second in-scope domain: TE carries ETCD as its topic variable; the 9-character value on row 1 fires."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 ETCD=RUNINPBOX
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
---
S1 | TE | RUNINPBOX | Placebo run-in
S1 | TE | RUNINPBO | Placebo run-in
